          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik **+ Condition** di toolbar bawah\n• **Drag** jenis node dari sidebar kiri ke canvas\n• Klik kanan di area kosong → **Add Condition**\n• **Double-click** di area kosong canvas",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;overflow:hidden;padding:14px 16px;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:7px;background:#eff6ff;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#2563eb;\">➕ + Condition</span><span style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:7px;background:#eff6ff;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#2563eb;\">📥 Drag dari sidebar</span><span style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:7px;background:#eff6ff;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#2563eb;\">🖱️ Klik kanan</span><span style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:7px;background:#eff6ff;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#2563eb;\">🔄 Double-click</span></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Jenis-Jenis Node yang Tersedia",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **CONSTANT** — Cek nilai tetap (amount > 10jt)\n• **CONTAINS / IN_LIST / REGEX** — Cek string dan daftar\n• **VARIABLE / FREQUENCY / RATIO** — Cek nilai dinamis\n• **DEVIATION** — Cek penyimpangan dari normal\n• **LOGICAL** — AND/OR/NOT untuk menggabungkan kondisi",
